<title>USA: Quaker Oats Co Q1 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Quaker Oats Co Q1 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.24		    $0.22</p>
<p> Oper net			NA			 NA</p>
<p> Revs		   1,201,700		1,222,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 136,305		  135,102</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 operating income before after-tax loss of $8.39 a share related to proposed sale of Snapple beverage business. Net loss for Q1 1997 was $1.11 billion or $8.15 a share.  </p>
<p>Q1 1997 income before charge was $34.2 million vs $32.2 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Year-ago Q1 operating net before $1.7 million or $0.01 a share gain on sale of Italian products business. Divested businesses contributed $46.4 million in sales and $8.2 million in operating income in year-ago period.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
